  m_text: "Carla Cap\xF4 is a streamer from Faro, Portugal. She is a charismatic
    individual and frequently tells jokes, one of the many reasons why her fanbase
    stays loyal to her. Carla has a good connection with her viewers and often threatens
    opponents with sending her army on them, sometimes as a joke and when things
    are more serious. \r\n\r\nSpecial effects:\r\nHas a Shudder chat."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
