  m_text: "Lars-G\xF6ran is a very competitive individual from Dalarna, Sweden. He
    was a soldier during the war, which . Lars-G\xF6ran frequently tries to distract
    his opponents by calling them names or telling dark jokes during the race.\r\n\nSpecial
    effects:\r\nLars-G\xF6ran is decent at everything."
